    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60858" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύνθος</span></b> , ὁ,
			<u>Cynthus</u>, a mountain in Delos, birth-place of Apollo
		and Artemis, <i><span class="en">
			<u>h.Ap.</u>
			26
		</span></i>:—Adj.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύνθιος</span></b> , epith. of Apollo,
			<i><span class="en">
			Call.
			<u>Del.</u>
			10
		</span></i>; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δήλιε, Κυνθίαν ἔχων . . πέτραν</span>”
