					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					596
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυνθογενής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				15.25.9
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Besant.
			</span></i>).</div>
